Hi -- "pasting problem"?  Not sure what that means.

If what you meant is, your tip labels are being cut off, try:

increasing xlims more
decreasing tipcex
ask yourself if you really need such long tip labels in the first place (who are they for??)
make sure you are running the source() commands after each time you do library(BioGeoBEARS), so that you have the latest version of the code

Cheers,
Nick

