Hi, this is not a generic R help group -- when you get these non-BioGeoBEARS issues, please google them.

But, for Rcpp installation, try uninstalling Rcpp and then re-installing it:

remove.packages("Rcpp")
detach(Rcpp)
install.packages("Rcpp")

Cheers,
Nick

